title: "AI Incident Timeline & Evidence Dashboard"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-13
repository-code: "https://github.com/htenlik/apart-incident-dashboard"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A structured evidence dashboard reconstructing the 2026 OpenAI–Hugging Face
  incident from six public sources. The artifact contains 30 claim-level evidence
  records classified as Confirmed, Disputed, or Uncertain, together with eight
  evidence-linked Checks / Watch Next items.
